が嫌いな感じですかねー","ts":"1628348874.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8k3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5182c16e-88ae-44ca-a209-90f6e94bf0c7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あまり関わる気がなかった界隈に突如巻き込まれたのが納得いかない感じ","ts":"1628348792.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FNooy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84b77279-85e4-4025-8563-e247b1696ee6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(ブシロードはともかくバンドリの楽曲は個人的には割と好きです。良曲多いと思ってる。)","ts":"1628348762.033200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g=98R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6503ecec-5536-4ee4-b99e-87960b0908e0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"んー 曲的には好きな部類なんですけどね…","ts":"1628348692.032100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5WsMb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f5afa86-62ff-45c2-b1d4-37bdf5e42a95","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ああ、単に好きじゃないアーティストが OP 担当だったってだけの話か","ts":"1628348662.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zs0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c96ec663-9cf1-4b30-9758-3c8fb83407ea","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まずそこまでブシロードって会社に良い印象が無いのが1つかなー…\nバンドリもカバー楽曲でユーザを釣る商法があまり好きじゃない…","ts":"1628348621.030800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gt5w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f15143ec-c77f-4f8c-8848-d424173f94f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(どこが気になってるのか全然わからなくなってきたけどなんかこれ以上ツッコんでも仕方なさそうだ)","ts":"1628348492.028100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=dDK="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea4e5a55-aabd-4ce4-9bd0-666b5797a9b2","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"メンバーは同じでもいいから別名義なら納得できてたと思う","ts":"1628348440.027600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ONWe"}]}]
